  "goodToKnow": "Allerhand means all sorts of or a good deal of, and never changes: allerhand Leute, allerhand zu tun, Er hat allerhand erlebt. As an exclamation, Das ist ja allerhand! expresses indignation (that's a bit much!) or admiration (that's quite something!). It's a bit old-fashioned. Similar: allerlei (all kinds of), mancherlei, vielerlei. Hand here is an old word for kind or sort."
